===== 4. ★ 快照：唯一索引谓词（uk_biz_cost_period 必须排除 REVERSED/CANCELLED） =====
uk_biz_cost_alloc_result :: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_biz_cost_alloc_result ON public.biz_cost_alloc_result USING btree (period_code, rule_id, cost_object_id, account_code)
uk_biz_cost_item :: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_biz_cost_item ON public.biz_cost_period_item USING btree (period_id, cost_object_id)
uk_biz_cost_period :: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_biz_cost_period ON public.biz_cost_period USING btree (org_id, period_code) WHERE ((deleted_at IS NULL) AND ((status)::text <> ALL ((ARRAY['REVERSED'::character varying, 'CANCELLED'::character varying])::text[])))
uk_biz_cost_period_no :: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_biz_cost_period_no ON public.biz_cost_period USING btree (batch_no) WHERE (deleted_at IS NULL)
uk_biz_cost_rule_code :: CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uk_biz_cost_rule_code ON public.biz_cost_alloc_rule USING btree (rule_code) WHERE (deleted_at IS NULL)

===== 5. ★ 卡面验收活体验证：同期间一条 REVERSED + 一条 SETTLED → 不冲突 =====
  → 探针成本对象已建
  → ① REVERSED 行（2026-01）插入成功
  → ② 同期间 SETTLED 行插入成功 ⇒ 不冲突（验收通过）
period_2026_01_rows=2（期望 2：一条 REVERSED + 一条 SETTLED）
→ 期望失败：同期间第三条**活跃**批次（唯一键必须拦，否则同月双结算）
ERROR:  duplicate key value violates unique constraint "uk_biz_cost_period"
DETAIL:  Key (org_id, period_code)=(00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000, 2026-01) already exists.
  → ③ 同期间第二条 REVERSED 插入成功（红冲留痕可多条）
period_2026_01_rows_now=3（期望 3 = 2 REVERSED + 1 SETTLED）
→ 期望失败：SETTLED 不带 settled_at / finish_voucher_id（假结算死单防线）
